  "description": "Simple Slug / Clean URL generator helper for Microsoft .NET framework and .NET Standard.\n\nWith default settings, you will get an hyphenized, lowercase, alphanumeric version of any string you please, with any diacritics removed and collapsed whitespace, collapsed dashes and trimmed whitespace.",
